    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26216" root="ضيف" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضِيفٌ</span></b>  a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصِيفٌ</span> [q. v.]. (TA.)
[ISd says that] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضِيفًا</span> occurring in a verse of
Aboo-Dhu-eyb [as some relate it], cited voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرَبَةٌ</span>, [where the reading of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصِيفًا</span> is given,] is
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَائِفًا</span>, meaning <i>Turning aside; crooked.</i> (M.)

